      "statement": "Grocery refrigeration (SIMULATED): any evening block in HB 6pm-9pm lifts the month's peak above where peak shaving alone puts it (748 kW, against 835 kW without storage); at 25 kW it rises 3 kW. The break point is 0 kW with or without the month-to-date ratchet."
